Subject: [PATCH] generator: retain raw char-array bytes behind Python 3 text fields

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Solo Python 3 legacy-dialect port]

The legacy decoder leaves PARAM_VALUE.param_id as padded bytes, but the owned
DroneKit public parameter map uses text keys. Generate text properties for char
arrays, backed by exact raw bytes for packing. UTF-8 with surrogateescape keeps
non-ASCII bytes reversible. Embedded NUL tails remain intact in raw forwarding;
text getters stop at the first NUL. Explicit assignment updates the raw value.
Do not change message definitions, numeric arrays, field order, lengths or CRCs.

--- a/generator/mavgen_python.py
+++ b/generator/mavgen_python.py
@@ -258,9 +258,28 @@
                 if (field.type != "char" and field.array_length > 1):
                         for i in range(field.array_length):
                                 outf.write(", self.{0:s}[{1:d}]".format(field.name,i))
+                elif field.type == "char" and field.array_length:
+                        outf.write(", self._{0:s}_raw".format(field.name))
                 else:
                         outf.write(", self.{0:s}".format(field.name))
         outf.write("))\n")
+        # Expose NUL-terminated text to Python 3 consumers while preserving the
+        # complete raw field for byte-identical forwarding, including NUL tails.
+        for field in m.fields:
+                if field.type == "char" and field.array_length:
+                        outf.write("""
+        @property
+        def {name}(self):
+                return self._{name}_raw.split(b'\\x00', 1)[0].decode('utf-8', 'surrogateescape')
+
+        @{name}.setter
+        def {name}(self, value):
+                if isinstance(value, str):
+                        value = value.encode('utf-8', 'surrogateescape')
+                elif not isinstance(value, (bytes, bytearray)):
+                        raise TypeError('MAVLink char array requires text or bytes')
+                self._{name}_raw = bytes(value)
+""".format(name=field.name))
 
 
 def native_mavfmt(field):
@@ -475,7 +494,7 @@
                     try:
                         m = self.decode(mbuf)
                     except MAVError as reason:
-                        m = MAVLink_bad_data(mbuf, reason.message)
+                        m = MAVLink_bad_data(mbuf, str(reason))
                         self.total_receive_errors += 1
                 else:
                     m = self.decode(mbuf)
@@ -551,7 +570,7 @@
                             L = len_map[order]
                             tip = sum(len_map[:order])
                             field = t[tip]
-                            if L == 1 or isinstance(field, str):
+                            if L == 1 or isinstance(field, (str, bytes)):
                                 tlist.append(field)
                             else:
                                 tlist.append(t[tip:(tip + L)])
